{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24856","headline":"登紫霄峰赠黄仙师 · 杨衡","name":"登紫霄峰赠黄仙师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫霄不可涉，灵峯信穹崇。\n下有琼树枝，上有翠发翁。\n鸡鸣秋汉侧，日出红霞中。\n璨璨真仙子，执旄爲侍童。\n焚香杳忘言，默念合太空。\n世华徒熠耀，虚室自朦胧。\n云飞琼瑶圃，龟息芝兰藂。\n玉籙掩不开，天窗微微风。\n兹焉悟佳旨，尘境亦幽通。\n浩渺临广津，永用挹无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}